==Overview==
Boss Toilet 5.0 is an Exclusive Unit released in the [[Episode 77 Part 4 Update]]. 
=='''Obtainment''' ==
It can be obtained from the Exclusive Shop for a price of [[File:Robux.png|frameless|27x27px]]599. It can also be traded for in the [[Trading Plaza]] or bought in the [[Marketplace]] or being gifted from the [[Post Office]]. 
