==Trivia==
*The unit has a weird icon, the logo of the boss toilet 4.0 unit in front of a toilet, it's probably a placeholder icon.
*As of 04/03/25, it is unlikely to be a placeholder now. 
*Best starter so far with a DPS of 16,000 and a placement cost of $600 at level 1.
*It's a pretty good unit as it spawns toilets and does a whopping 175,000 DPS AND the ally health (when maxed out) is 1,000,000.
*This unit, currently has '''one of the highest cost efficiency,''' reaching '''A WHOOPING 26.67,''' only to be beaten by [[Titan Samurai Cameraman]] with '''116,666.''' 
